  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just One Things**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **One in the Same**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **What's Going On**: back after 44 archived shows (789 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **In Color**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Grab a Body**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **outro: Analog Mike's 100th show**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2023-11-09.at943.engsky** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 146 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jim congratulates Analog Mike, a frequent front-row regular, on attending his 100th show, marked in the outro [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2023-11-09.at943.engsky**: taped by EnglishSkylarking; source: AT943 > SP-ATEN-1 > SP-SAPM-1-USB-C > Zenfone 8 [1]. Also: Recorded with Audio-Technica AT943 mics through Sound Professionals SP-CMC-8 into a Pfitzinger Voice Design Field Recorder, 24-bit/48kHz, AGC and limiter off; Post-processed with iZotope RX 10 phase adjustment, Sound Forge minor EQ and fades, resampled to 16-bit/44.1kHz, then encoded to FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [My Morning Jacket Concert The Chicago Theatre Chicago Il Nov 9 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/my-morning-jacket-concert-the-chicago-theatre-chicago-il-nov-9-2023-poster) [3]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [My Morning Jacket Chicago The Chicago Theatre Nov 9 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/my-morning-jacket-chicago-the-chicago-theatre-nov-9-2023-poster) [4]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [My Morning Jacket Chicago The Chicago Theatre Nov 9 2023 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/my-morning-jacket-chicago-the-chicago-theatre-nov-9-2023-poster) [5]",
